 * The public API of a Java source as a compact stub: type headers, public fields, public
 * constructors and methods with their bodies removed, nested types kept. Comments other than
 * the first javadoc of the file are dropped. Good enough for our own patterns (lint keeps them
 * plain); not a Java parser.
